[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595343016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113355#issuecomment-3595343016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113355","id":3595343016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WTJSo","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T08:54:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T08:54:35Z","body":"Is 2560 x 1664 the native \"full\" resolution of the monitor, or the current scaled resolution you've set it to in the system settings? Godot is a little fidgety with macOS high resolution retina scaling as it seems to always use actual screen pixels for sizes rather than the scaled resolution units you might expect from macOS development and use.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595343016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595628594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113355#issuecomment-3595628594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113355","id":3595628594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WUPAy","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T09:57:28Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T09:57:28Z","body":"`screen_get_size` returns size in rendered pixels, while includes UI scaling, and will only match real display resolution if scaling is at 100%.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595628594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595654190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113355#issuecomment-3595654190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113355","id":3595654190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WUVQu","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T10:01:15Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T10:01:15Z","body":"It should match the value returned by `system_profiler SPDisplaysDataType` command. macOS system settings usually show `UI Looks like` value, which is either the same or 2x smaller, since macOS API doesn't support fractional scaling, despite OS using it. Neither usually match physical resolution.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595654190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595711102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113355#issuecomment-3595711102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113355","id":3595711102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WUjJ-","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T10:13:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T10:13:32Z","body":"For built-in screen of M2 MacBook Air, standard resolutions are:\n\n- 1710×1112@2 (3420×2224)\n- 1470×956@2 (2940×1912) ← default fractional scale\n- 1280×832@2 (2560×1664) ← native resolution\n- 1024×666@2 (2048×1332)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3595711102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602587047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113355#issuecomment-3602587047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113355","id":3602587047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wux2n","user":{"login":"TrampolineTales","id":12213194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjEzMTk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12213194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales","html_url":"https://github.com/TrampolineTales","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T15:22:58Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T15:22:58Z","body":"> It should match the value returned by `system_profiler SPDisplaysDataType` command. macOS system settings usually show `UI Looks like` value, which is either the same or 2x smaller, since macOS API doesn't support fractional scaling, despite OS using it. Neither usually match physical resolution.\n\nRunning `system_profiler SPDisplaysDataType` returns 2560 x 1664 on the Mac that returns 2940 x 1912 from the MRP.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602587047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3618570790","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113355#issuecomment-3618570790","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113355","id":3618570790,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XrwIm","user":{"login":"TrampolineTales","id":12213194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjEzMTk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12213194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrampolineTales","html_u